      "note": "d&b audiotechnik D80 page (opened 2026-11-12): dimensions \"2 RU x 19 in x 530 mm\", 19 kg; connectors: analog inputs A1 to A4 3-pin XLR female, analog links 3-pin XLR male, digital inputs D1/2 and D3/4 3-pin XLR female (AES3), digital link 3-pin XLR male, one 4-channel output on NL8, speaker outputs A to D on NL4, CAN 2 x RJ45 in parallel, Ethernet 2 x etherCON, mains powerCON HC. Only the depth is printed in mm: 2 RU and 19 in are mapped to 88.9 and 482.6 mm by us (axis order assumed, so the size is an estimate and the device is beta-modelled). The mains connector (powerCON HC) has no catalogue connector: modelled as powercon-blue (the closest connector of the Beta proposal), the only assumed connector (a mains inlet)."
